| [IGI 1.98ct D-FL](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29230615?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | D-FL | [$3,848](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29230615?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | Near-2ct Flawless — proportions matter even more at larger face-up area |
